You align the clues you have seen or heard:

— a circular burn mark at 412 °C in sector 4;
— a shunt deliberately placed on the panel, according to Dorian;
— a crystalline residue secretly collected by Maya from Sample 7;
— forty-three seconds without sensors at 02:13, according to ORIS;
— an enthusiastic message from Léo at 01:58, never followed up.

No single piece explains everything. But all converge on the same instant.
